Traitor
One of the slaves is a traitor who is willing to reveal the secret of the Last Shelter. Fortunately he insists on speaking only to an officer of the guards and will not speak to the privates. The traitor must be killed before he spills the beans!
#subobj  1
Finding the guards' mess
The treacherous slave awaits the officers in the privates' mess on the eastern river bank, in the southern sector of the irrigated fields.
#subobj  2
Finding the traitor
You can easily tell the treacherous slave apart from the soldiers by his clothes.
#subobj  3
Killing the traitor
The traitor must die before he talks!